# Wave W17-L (Route 101): camp turf — young camp-meadow green, fresh and light, calm speckled with pale seed heads standing in it (design: calm speckled grass, young trees and flower tufts; every Maris journey starts with this grass on its shoes). Route 101’s own ground — the lightest, youngest green in Maris, split from Route 102’s deep pond green by value.
